^["anderson_charles_rees_2022"]{
 title: "Reexamining the Contribution of Public Health Efforts to the Decline in Urban Mortality"
 authors: "D. Mark Anderson; Kerwin Kofi Charles; Daniel I. Rees"
 year: 2022, venue: "American Economic Journal: Applied Economics 14(2):126-157, doi 10.1257/app.20190034; NBER Working Paper 25027, 2018"
